1.  START                                              [Terminator]
2.  Load campus graph (locations, edges, distances)    [Process]
3.  Read source S and destination D                    [Input/Output]
4.  Are S and D valid?                                 [Decision]
      No  -> Display "Invalid input" -> back to 3
      Yes -> continue
5.  Is S = D?                                          [Decision]
      Yes -> Display "Distance = 0 m" -> go to 17
      No  -> continue
6.  Initialise: dist[all] = INF, parent[all] = -1,
    dist[S] = 0, all vertices unvisited                [Process]
7.  Are there unvisited vertices left?                 [Decision]
      No  -> go to 11
      Yes -> continue
8.  Select unvisited vertex u with minimum dist[u]     [Process]
9.  Is dist[u] = INF?                                  [Decision]
      Yes -> go to 11
      No  -> continue
10. Mark u visited. For each neighbour v of u:
    if dist[u] + w < dist[v], update dist[v]
    and set parent[v] = u -> go back to 7              [Process]
11. Is dist[D] = INF?                                  [Decision]
      Yes -> Display "Destination not reachable" -> go to 14
      No  -> continue
12. Rebuild path from D to S using parent[]
    and reverse it                                     [Process]
13. Display route and total distance dist[D] metres    [Input/Output]
14. Another query?                                     [Decision]
      Yes -> back to 3
      No  -> continue
15. STOP                                               [Terminator]
